{
 "version": 1,
 "id": "2023-10-16-WesternUSEvent-W1-5-gossamer",
 "description": {
  "en": "We started looking around the area and approximately an hour or two later as we were stopped we observed some dust and thick spider web looking material floating in-front of us. We then saw what looked like the same object floating in a more vertical orientation floating with the dust. It was still at an off angle. I could see where the spots were for the two lights and one being round and the other square. The lights were not on though. The object itself was still hard to define its shape and borders visually. It was in the air about 15-20 feet up and as it floated past I could see a star through the object, as well as the crest of the hill and some vegetation. It was almost like looking at something through water where it was not completely clear.",
  "fr": "Nous avons commencé à chercher dans le secteur et, une heure ou deux plus tard, alors que nous étions arrêtés, nous avons vu de la poussière et une matière ressemblant à une épaisse toile d'araignée flotter devant nous. Puis nous avons vu ce qui semblait être le même objet, flottant plus à la verticale avec la poussière, toujours en biais. Je voyais l'emplacement des deux feux, l'un rond, l'autre carré, mais ils n'étaient pas allumés. Sa forme et ses contours restaient difficiles à distinguer. Il était à 4,5-6 m de haut, et quand il est passé, j'ai vu à travers une étoile, la crête de la colline et de la végétation, presque comme si l'on regardait à travers de l'eau."
 },
